00:00:18.618 --> 00:00:23.957 size:53% position:73% line:53%
♪ Je me promène ♪

00:00:19.853 --> 00:00:25.158 size:53% position:73% line:53%
♪ J'aime regarder ♪

00:00:23.056 --> 00:00:26.393 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Ariane, j'étais tellement

00:00:24.257 --> 00:00:27.594 size:53% position:73% line:53%
content quand j'ai appris que

00:00:25.458 --> 00:00:28.828 size:53% position:73% line:53%
c'était toi la Révélation Radio-

00:00:26.693 --> 00:00:30.030 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Canada, parce que tu es une

00:00:27.894 --> 00:00:31.264 size:53% position:73% line:53%
