00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:37.370 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ARIANE ROY, auteur-compositrice-

00:00:35.202 --> 00:00:38.572 size:53% position:73% line:53%
interprète, Révélation R.-C.

00:00:36.436 --> 00:00:39.773 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Oui. J'ai lancé le EP

00:00:37.671 --> 00:00:41.007 size:53% position:73% line:53%
